sequenceDiagram
    participant Officer as Officer (React SPA)
    participant Backend as Spring Boot API
    participant MLService as FastAPI ML Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Officer->>Backend: GET /advisory-requests/{id} (load request details)
    Backend->>DB: Fetch advisory request and farm
    DB-->>Backend: Return farm and request
    Backend-->>Officer: Return request data + latest soil reading

    Officer->>Backend: POST /advisory-requests/{id}/respond (with response text)
    Backend->>Backend: Validate request and officer
    Backend->>MLService: POST /predict (with soil reading data: N, P, K, pH, rainfall, temperature)
    MLService->>MLService: Load model, predict top 3 crops
    MLService-->>Backend: Return top 3 crop suggestions
    Backend->>Backend: Save advisory request response with AI suggestions
    Backend-->>Officer: Return success + AI suggestions displayed in UI